1
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:39,710
[Abyss]

2
00:01:40,570 --> 00:01:41,560
Pengfei, get up.

3
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,560
Let him pick it up.

4
00:01:43,310 --> 00:01:44,479
It's fine. I'll pick it up myself.

5
00:01:44,479 --> 00:01:45,509
Get up.

6
00:01:52,660 --> 00:01:53,410
Pick it up!

7
00:01:55,650 --> 00:01:57,580
I asked you to do my homework

8
00:01:58,259 --> 00:02:00,200
'cause I took a pity on you

9
00:02:00,510 --> 00:02:03,110
for having no father
to teach you filial piety.

10
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:07,290
What are you glaring at?

11
00:02:08,810 --> 00:02:09,710
Who do you think you are?

12
00:02:09,710 --> 00:02:11,310
You unwanted bastard.

13
00:02:11,370 --> 00:02:13,120
Really think you're something?

14
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,890
Do you know what
your mom is doing right now?

15
00:02:14,890 --> 00:02:16,530
She's busy finding you a new dad

16
00:02:16,530 --> 00:02:17,530
and having a second child.

17
00:02:17,530 --> 00:02:18,620
If I were you...

18
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:22,590
He's walking all over you.

19
00:02:22,900 --> 00:02:24,250
If you don't fight back,

20
00:02:24,270 --> 00:02:26,000
you'll never hold your head up.

21
00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:30,900
I don't know how to fight,

22
00:02:30,900 --> 00:02:31,900
and I never have.

23
00:02:33,530 --> 00:02:34,310
It's okay.

24
00:02:35,220 --> 00:02:36,079
I'll teach you.

25
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:37,690
Bro, I was wrong.

26
00:02:37,690 --> 00:02:38,400
Bro.

27
00:02:43,420 --> 00:02:48,250
[Episode 15]

28
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,410
Wang, Ding,

29
00:02:57,430 --> 00:02:59,020
I brought you some late-night snacks.

30
00:02:59,020 --> 00:03:00,680
Thanks. I'm famished.

31
00:02:59,090 --> 00:03:01,450
[Huangshui Public Security]

32
00:03:04,210 --> 00:03:05,520
Perfect timing.

33
00:03:10,190 --> 00:03:11,190
If I keep staring,

34
00:03:11,190 --> 00:03:12,910
my eyes will turn into code.

35
00:03:13,780 --> 00:03:14,360
Here.

36
00:03:16,020 --> 00:03:17,090
How's it going?

37
00:03:18,930 --> 00:03:19,860
Not optimistic.

38
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:22,000
[Running algorithms]

39
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:23,120
We're just relying
on computing power and luck.

40
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:25,310
With the county bureau's
current resources,

41
00:03:25,310 --> 00:03:26,620
I can't even tell you

42
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:27,910
the estimated time.

43
00:03:27,910 --> 00:03:29,710
I'm afraid it'll be a blow to you.

44
00:03:30,730 --> 00:03:31,550
Understood.

45
00:03:32,550 --> 00:03:33,590
Thanks for your hard work.

46
00:03:33,590 --> 00:03:34,700
Rest after eating.

47
00:03:34,740 --> 00:03:35,870
Don't exhaust yourselves.

48
00:03:35,870 --> 00:03:37,600
We're just grinding away here.

49
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:39,590
Go back and think about it some more.

50
00:03:39,590 --> 00:03:41,130
If you have a flash of inspiration,

51
00:03:41,130 --> 00:03:42,560
we won't have to do this.

52
00:03:43,140 --> 00:03:43,920
Don't worry.

53
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:46,020
I'll head back now and keep thinking.

54
00:03:46,740 --> 00:03:47,610
Thanks!

55
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:57,600
[Han Pinmu's birthday]
[Game account]
[Bank Card]

56
00:03:58,340 --> 00:04:00,400
The three of us each stabbed him once.

57
00:04:00,590 --> 00:04:01,690
A blood pact.

58
00:04:03,330 --> 00:04:04,940
[Han Pinmu's birthday: 19840321]

59
00:04:04,970 --> 00:04:06,850
[Hu Xiaofei's birthday: 19840915]

60
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:11,900
[Xin Xiaoliang's birthday: 19850822]

61
00:04:25,620 --> 00:04:27,100
Here, have some noodles.

62
00:04:27,100 --> 00:04:27,980
Thanks, Mom.

63
00:04:28,270 --> 00:04:30,200
Go to bed early after eating, okay?

64
00:04:30,450 --> 00:04:31,330
Got it.

65
00:05:19,890 --> 00:05:20,570
Two years after

66
00:05:20,570 --> 00:05:22,720
this woman hooked up with my dad,

67
00:05:22,750 --> 00:05:24,190
on April 28th, 2001,

68
00:05:24,190 --> 00:05:26,160
my mom died in a sudden car crash.

69
00:05:28,010 --> 00:05:29,540
Those two can finally be together.

70
00:05:29,540 --> 00:05:31,670
How could there be such a coincidence?

71
00:05:32,020 --> 00:05:34,250
It's like destiny.

72
00:05:38,020 --> 00:05:44,140
[Huangshui Public Security]

73
00:05:40,159 --> 00:05:41,040
Wang.

74
00:05:41,370 --> 00:05:42,159
Wang!

75
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:47,180
I just fell asleep.

76
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:48,390
Let me try again.

77
00:05:52,130 --> 00:05:54,430
[Encryption password: 010428143]

78
00:05:54,909 --> 00:05:55,850
[Audio]

79
00:05:57,300 --> 00:05:58,480
Finally done.

80
00:05:58,620 --> 00:05:59,720
Take your stuff away quickly.

81
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:01,980
I'm going to sleep
for 3 days and 3 nights.

82
00:06:02,410 --> 00:06:04,410
[Audio]

83
00:06:09,910 --> 00:06:10,760
Play it again.

84
00:06:19,190 --> 00:06:20,630
Wh-What's wrong with her?

85
00:06:20,630 --> 00:06:21,830
Why is she not moving?

86
00:06:22,250 --> 00:06:23,870
She seems to have stopped breathing.

87
00:06:23,870 --> 00:06:25,320
We were just scaring her.

88
00:06:25,570 --> 00:06:26,480
What do we do?

89
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,060
What are you doing?

90
00:06:28,060 --> 00:06:29,030
Stop him!

91
00:06:30,100 --> 00:06:31,720
Why did you stab her?

92
00:06:35,010 --> 00:06:35,950
It sounds like

93
00:06:35,980 --> 00:06:37,210
an audio clip

94
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:39,320
from the crime scene of Du Juan's case.

95
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:40,920
The cybersecurity colleagues
have confirmed it.

96
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:41,860
The time of the recording

97
00:06:41,860 --> 00:06:44,100
matches the time of Du Juan's death.

98
00:06:44,450 --> 00:06:45,670
The woman's voice in the background

99
00:06:45,670 --> 00:06:47,460
is Du Juan.

100
00:06:48,159 --> 00:06:49,760
The ones talking are two men.

101
00:06:49,820 --> 00:06:52,550
But judging from the line
"stop him,"

102
00:06:53,159 --> 00:06:55,010
there was at least
a fourth person present

103
00:06:55,010 --> 00:06:56,409
who didn't say anything.

104
00:06:56,810 --> 00:06:59,010
Why would they record this at the scene?

105
00:06:59,250 --> 00:07:00,540
They probably wanted to record

106
00:07:00,540 --> 00:07:01,690
Du Juan confessing

107
00:07:01,690 --> 00:07:03,800
to killing Han Pinmu's mother.

108
00:07:04,220 --> 00:07:05,410
But they didn't expect

109
00:07:05,410 --> 00:07:07,100
Du Juan to have a sudden heart attack.

110
00:07:07,100 --> 00:07:08,350
The key now is

111
00:07:08,430 --> 00:07:10,360
to identify these two speakers.

112
00:07:10,570 --> 00:07:11,300
Li Cheng,

113
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:13,540
you've dealt with Han Pinmu the most.

114
00:07:13,890 --> 00:07:15,040
Based on the voices just now,

115
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,130
is he one of them?

116
00:07:16,930 --> 00:07:18,190
Doesn't sound like it.

117
00:07:18,220 --> 00:07:19,500
It could also be Hu Xiaofei
and Xin Xiaoliang,

118
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:21,390
like he said.

119
00:07:21,430 --> 00:07:22,690
Then Han Pinmu

120
00:07:22,690 --> 00:07:25,100
could also be the one
who didn't say anything.

121
00:07:25,100 --> 00:07:27,750
The silent one has
the lowest presence there.

122
00:07:27,980 --> 00:07:29,700
With Han Pinmu's personality,

123
00:07:29,700 --> 00:07:31,760
he wouldn't take orders from others.

124
00:07:32,170 --> 00:07:33,730
After all this,

125
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:35,909
it still comes back to Xin's family.

126
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:40,050
Where on earth did this guy go?

127
00:07:43,430 --> 00:07:46,080
Manager, this gentleman says
he's looking for you.

128
00:07:43,580 --> 00:07:44,310
[No smoking]

129
00:07:44,700 --> 00:07:47,510
[No smoking]

130
00:07:50,100 --> 00:07:50,800
Have a seat.

131
00:07:52,580 --> 00:07:53,250
You can go.

132
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:58,580
Sir,

133
00:07:58,830 --> 00:08:00,070
what can I do for you?

134
00:08:00,370 --> 00:08:01,870
In 2003,

135
00:08:02,690 --> 00:08:04,690
you hosted a 3v3

136
00:08:04,690 --> 00:08:06,930
street basketball tournament here, right?

137
00:08:06,930 --> 00:08:09,050
You mean the Final Whistle Cup?

138
00:08:10,310 --> 00:08:12,890
We held it every year

139
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,430
from 2000 to 2008.

140
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:17,730
It was our flagship event back then.

141
00:08:18,330 --> 00:08:19,120
What about it?

142
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:21,380
Show me the registration list and photos

143
00:08:21,750 --> 00:08:22,630
from that year.

144
00:08:23,300 --> 00:08:25,300
It's been a long time.

145
00:08:25,670 --> 00:08:27,120
We only had paper records back then,

146
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,980
buried in the corner of the warehouse.

147
00:08:28,980 --> 00:08:30,020
It's hard to find.

148
00:08:30,050 --> 00:08:31,480
So it can still be found.

149
00:08:31,500 --> 00:08:32,210
Look for it.

150
00:08:33,820 --> 00:08:34,809
Sir,

151
00:08:35,100 --> 00:08:36,390
may I ask

152
00:08:36,549 --> 00:08:38,289
why you're looking for this?

153
00:08:39,780 --> 00:08:40,610
For a case.

154
00:08:40,809 --> 00:08:41,730
What case?

155
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,049
A murder case.

156
00:08:44,500 --> 00:08:45,930
Are you a police officer?

157
00:08:50,090 --> 00:08:51,220
I'm a parent.

158
00:08:51,740 --> 00:08:54,090
[Huangshui No.2 High School teachers]

159
00:08:55,410 --> 00:08:56,580
Hello, Director Li.

160
00:08:56,800 --> 00:08:58,960
This is Li Cheng
from the county criminal police.

161
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,500
I need you to help me find

162
00:09:00,630 --> 00:09:02,250
audio and video recordings
of former students

163
00:09:02,250 --> 00:09:05,000
Han Pinmu and Hu Xiaofei.

164
00:09:07,290 --> 00:09:11,570
[Huangshui Public Security]

165
00:09:07,580 --> 00:09:10,010
Like from sports meets, art performances—

166
00:09:10,010 --> 00:09:11,010
anything will do.

167
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:14,490
Yes, it's very urgent.

168
00:09:16,790 --> 00:09:17,460
Okay.

169
00:09:16,860 --> 00:09:24,060
[Huangshui Public Security]

170
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:20,340
Please contact me immediately
if you have any news.

171
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:21,280
Thank you.

172
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,550
Xin Xiaoliang's is easy to get.

173
00:09:23,550 --> 00:09:25,020
That kid used to go to the police station

174
00:09:25,020 --> 00:09:26,220
like going home.

175
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:27,340
I've already asked those I know
at the station

176
00:09:27,340 --> 00:09:28,790
to pull up the interrogation videos
from back then.

177
00:09:28,790 --> 00:09:29,980
We'll have news soon.

178
00:09:29,980 --> 00:09:30,690
Okay.

179
00:09:30,950 --> 00:09:33,550
By the way,
shall we eat at the cafeteria later?

180
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,480
I'm going to the hospital.

181
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:36,150
All right.

182
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:41,770
You're here.

183
00:09:41,770 --> 00:09:42,620
Come, sit.

184
00:09:45,670 --> 00:09:46,980
Any progress?

185
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,170
He's doing much better
than when he first arrived.

186
00:09:49,170 --> 00:09:50,930
His vital signs are basically stable.

187
00:09:50,930 --> 00:09:52,890
We took him off vasopressors yesterday,

188
00:09:52,890 --> 00:09:54,600
which is a good sign.

189
00:09:55,550 --> 00:09:57,220
Are there any signs of him waking up?

190
00:09:57,220 --> 00:09:58,890
Based on the latest assessment,

191
00:09:58,890 --> 00:10:00,000
his current condition is

192
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,170
what we medically call

193
00:10:01,170 --> 00:10:03,010
a minimally conscious state.

194
00:10:03,030 --> 00:10:05,840
He's not in a deep,
completely unconscious coma.

195
00:10:04,630 --> 00:10:10,130
[ICU]

196
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,450
We've run tests,

197
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:09,290
and his auditory nerves are intact.

198
00:10:09,290 --> 00:10:10,630
He can hear sounds,

199
00:10:10,910 --> 00:10:13,340
but his brain can't process them,

200
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:15,650
let alone command his body to respond.

201
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:16,960
So

202
00:10:17,090 --> 00:10:19,490
there's still hope
he might wake up, right?

203
00:10:20,010 --> 00:10:21,340
Well...

204
00:10:21,500 --> 00:10:22,410
I can only say

205
00:10:22,410 --> 00:10:24,650
things are moving in a positive direction.

206
00:10:24,650 --> 00:10:26,450
He might wake up the next second,

207
00:10:26,620 --> 00:10:29,250
or it could take a longer time.

208
00:10:29,290 --> 00:10:30,500
It's hard to say.

209
00:10:35,020 --> 00:10:36,760
[Public Security]

210
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,000
We're back!

211
00:10:54,250 --> 00:10:55,030
How did it go?

212
00:10:56,500 --> 00:10:57,630
I need a sip.

213
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:00,360
Hurry up.

214
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,290
How did it go?

215
00:11:02,580 --> 00:11:04,620
There are quite a few people named
Guo San-something in Quanlin County.

216
00:11:04,620 --> 00:11:05,890
We filtered through them,

217
00:11:05,890 --> 00:11:07,630
but the age and gender didn't match.

218
00:11:07,630 --> 00:11:09,870
Then we refused to leave the local bureau

219
00:11:09,870 --> 00:11:11,820
and went through old
missing persons files for 2 days

220
00:11:11,820 --> 00:11:12,670
and we finally found him.

221
00:11:12,670 --> 00:11:14,440
His name is Guo Sanjun.

222
00:11:16,550 --> 00:11:17,750
Guo Sanjun?

223
00:11:18,100 --> 00:11:19,150
Are you sure?

224
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:20,320
Pretty much.

225
00:11:21,390 --> 00:11:22,050
This is

226
00:11:22,050 --> 00:11:23,770
a copy of the missing persons
registration form

227
00:11:23,770 --> 00:11:24,580
from back then.

228
00:11:24,580 --> 00:11:27,170
His height, weight,
and physical features all match.

229
00:11:27,170 --> 00:11:28,580
He was reported missing in 1997,

230
00:11:28,430 --> 00:11:31,270
[Quan Lin County Public Security Bureau
Missing Person Registration Form]

231
00:11:28,580 --> 00:11:29,270
and there have been

232
00:11:29,270 --> 00:11:31,360
no records of him since.

233
00:11:38,860 --> 00:11:39,750
What's wrong?

234
00:11:40,820 --> 00:11:42,250
Why the long faces?

235
00:11:42,330 --> 00:11:43,460
We made a breakthrough.

236
00:11:43,460 --> 00:11:45,150
Why do you look so upset?

237
00:11:45,170 --> 00:11:46,770
Han Pinmu turned himself in.

238
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:49,080
He confessed to the Du Juan case.

239
00:11:49,670 --> 00:11:51,130
One of his self-incriminating proofs is

240
00:11:51,130 --> 00:11:53,100
that the fake Song Laifu's real name

241
00:11:53,100 --> 00:11:54,000
is Guo Sanjun.

242
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,630
Doesn't that match up?

243
00:11:55,890 --> 00:11:57,320
We worked so hard,

244
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,580
and he couldn't handle the pressure
and confessed.

245
00:11:58,580 --> 00:11:59,580
That's a good thing.

246
00:11:59,580 --> 00:12:01,240
What's so good about it?

247
00:12:01,460 --> 00:12:03,320
You two go back, take a shower,
and get some sleep.

248
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:04,820
Your brains are rusty!

249
00:12:05,500 --> 00:12:07,750
We'll catch you up when you get back.

250
00:12:06,870 --> 00:12:08,970
[Song Laifu;
Real name: Guo Sanjun]

251
00:12:18,770 --> 00:12:20,200
Manager, I found them.

252
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:21,410
The registration forms from 2003

253
00:12:21,410 --> 00:12:22,240
are all here.

254
00:12:25,390 --> 00:12:26,650
Give them to him first.

255
00:12:30,280 --> 00:12:31,610
[Registration Form]

256
00:12:37,930 --> 00:12:44,320
[Registration Form]

257
00:12:52,520 --> 00:12:53,280
[Registration Form]

258
00:12:53,750 --> 00:12:54,980
[Name: Wan Kai]

259
00:12:55,050 --> 00:13:00,000
[Name: Hu Xiaofei]

260
00:13:03,510 --> 00:13:06,150
[Registration Form]
[Name: Hu Xiaofei]

261
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:10,260
[Registration Form]
[Name: Hu Xiaofei]

262
00:13:13,900 --> 00:13:15,090
[Registration Form]

263
00:13:15,220 --> 00:13:16,190
[Name: Yang Xiaohui]

264
00:13:16,280 --> 00:13:21,400
[Name: Han Pinmu]

265
00:13:31,140 --> 00:13:34,860
[Registration Form]
[Name: Han Pinmu]

266
00:13:46,550 --> 00:13:50,420
[Registration Form]

267
00:13:52,690 --> 00:13:53,210
[Registration Form]

268
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:20,790
[Name: Xin Xiaoliang]

269
00:14:27,070 --> 00:14:29,590
[Registration Form]
[Name: Xin Xiaoliang]

270
00:14:29,940 --> 00:14:31,300
Xin Jiran,

271
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:34,550
you are a good cop.

272
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:38,370
You are a good cop.

273
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:45,870
You are a good cop.

274
00:15:00,630 --> 00:15:01,560
I am...

275
00:15:04,180 --> 00:15:05,170
not.

276
00:15:15,150 --> 00:15:16,530
I am not.

277
00:15:21,370 --> 00:15:24,180
♪ I made a mistake ♪

278
00:15:21,390 --> 00:15:24,250
[Weishui County
Middle School Drama Festival]

279
00:15:23,530 --> 00:15:24,870
For your happiness,

280
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:27,090
my purse, my person,

281
00:15:26,290 --> 00:15:29,050
♪ That no one can know ♪

282
00:15:27,170 --> 00:15:28,670
my extremest means,

283
00:15:28,670 --> 00:15:29,790
lie all unlocked

284
00:15:30,410 --> 00:15:31,620
to your occasions.

285
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:34,030
♪ I prayed and I prayed ♪

286
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,010
But

287
00:15:34,750 --> 00:15:35,860
I am also afraid.

288
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:40,460
♪ But the screaming took hold ♪

289
00:15:36,150 --> 00:15:38,790
I'm afraid that this generosity

290
00:15:40,250 --> 00:15:42,360
will eventually push me into the Abyss.

291
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:44,910
I want to shake your hand

292
00:15:42,640 --> 00:15:45,450
♪ I once fell into a dream ♪

293
00:15:45,910 --> 00:15:47,680
and say goodbye without regrets,

294
00:15:46,610 --> 00:15:50,160
♪ Inside I lost my name ♪

295
00:15:47,910 --> 00:15:48,700
because

296
00:15:49,110 --> 00:15:50,970
nothing in this world

297
00:15:51,910 --> 00:15:55,550
♪ The sun shone on my face ♪

298
00:15:52,280 --> 00:15:53,940
makes me feel the value of life

299
00:15:55,270 --> 00:15:57,360
more than your friendship.

300
00:15:56,160 --> 00:16:02,620
♪ But mockery's all that shows—
who's who? ♪

301
00:15:57,800 --> 00:15:59,420
If you are moved

302
00:16:00,020 --> 00:16:01,290
by my death,

303
00:16:01,510 --> 00:16:02,250
then

304
00:16:04,220 --> 00:16:05,750
for friendship's sake,

305
00:16:08,010 --> 00:16:09,270
just pay off this debt

306
00:16:10,940 --> 00:16:12,010
and let it be.

307
00:16:13,190 --> 00:16:14,120
♪ Who is who? ♪

308
00:16:14,970 --> 00:16:17,270
♪ Who bears deep sin still praying? ♪

309
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:19,980
Play that audio

310
00:16:19,980 --> 00:16:21,100
for me again.

311
00:16:21,130 --> 00:16:21,630
Okay.

312
00:16:21,210 --> 00:16:22,230
[Recording.mp3]

313
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:30,890
Wh-What's wrong with her?

314
00:16:30,890 --> 00:16:32,090
Why is she not moving?

315
00:16:32,510 --> 00:16:34,170
She seems to have stopped breathing.

316
00:16:34,170 --> 00:16:35,700
We were just scaring her.

317
00:16:35,750 --> 00:16:36,790
What do we do?

318
00:16:37,340 --> 00:16:38,400
What are you doing?

319
00:16:38,410 --> 00:16:39,370
Stop him!

320
00:16:40,280 --> 00:16:41,920
Why did you stab her?

321
00:16:42,770 --> 00:16:44,010
We can almost be certain that

322
00:16:44,010 --> 00:16:46,080
Hu Xiaofei is the second speaker.

323
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:49,030
And he was indeed the one
who brought the knife.

324
00:16:49,030 --> 00:16:51,000
Have we confirmed Xin Xiaoliang's voice?

325
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:53,060
The station is retrieving the old...

326
00:16:53,640 --> 00:16:54,840
You can't go in there.

327
00:16:56,870 --> 00:16:57,510
Captain Fan,

328
00:16:57,510 --> 00:16:58,510
he barged in looking for you.

329
00:16:58,510 --> 00:16:59,720
I couldn't stop him.

330
00:17:13,510 --> 00:17:14,910
I'm here to make a report.

331
00:17:15,250 --> 00:17:16,329
Report what?

332
00:17:21,770 --> 00:17:23,680
To report my son, Xin Xiaoliang,

333
00:17:27,450 --> 00:17:29,570
as a suspect in the 3/12 Case.

334
00:17:33,290 --> 00:17:34,950
[Registration Form]
[Name: Xin Xiaoliang]

335
00:17:40,420 --> 00:17:41,280
Han Pinmu!

336
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:44,000
Open the door!

337
00:17:58,940 --> 00:18:00,470
What happened to your head?

338
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:03,440
I fell

339
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:04,740
and hit the table.

340
00:18:04,770 --> 00:18:06,970
I just cleaned up the blood on the floor.

341
00:18:08,210 --> 00:18:10,570
Officer Xin, are you visiting me so late

342
00:18:10,790 --> 00:18:13,190
because there's progress in my mom's case?

343
00:18:14,570 --> 00:18:16,160
Stop acting.

344
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:22,270
Why are you

345
00:18:22,750 --> 00:18:23,940
giving me this money?

346
00:18:23,940 --> 00:18:25,240
This isn't my money.

347
00:18:25,810 --> 00:18:27,290
Why would I give you money?

348
00:18:27,350 --> 00:18:29,160
I've been keeping an eye on you

349
00:18:29,510 --> 00:18:31,140
since Zhang Chengguo died.

350
00:18:31,170 --> 00:18:33,010
You sold your internet cafe
for 350,000 yuan

351
00:18:33,010 --> 00:18:35,130
and withdrew cash from the bank
in 4 installments.

352
00:18:35,130 --> 00:18:37,000
And then this 100,000

353
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:39,240
appeared in my pigeon cage.

354
00:18:40,900 --> 00:18:42,010
If it's not yours,

355
00:18:42,480 --> 00:18:43,550
whose could it be?

356
00:18:46,260 --> 00:18:48,280
It seems even the sharpest knife

357
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:49,880
gets dull with age.

358
00:18:50,380 --> 00:18:52,180
You said you've been keeping an eye on me.

359
00:18:52,180 --> 00:18:52,790
Then you should have

360
00:18:52,790 --> 00:18:54,590
caught me red-handed

361
00:18:54,590 --> 00:18:56,290
when I dropped off the money.

362
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:57,720
Han Pinmu,

363
00:18:57,770 --> 00:18:59,640
what the hell are you trying to do?

364
00:19:02,070 --> 00:19:04,090
This money isn't for you.

365
00:19:05,030 --> 00:19:06,160
It's for Xiaoliang.

366
00:19:12,330 --> 00:19:13,780
You know Xiaoliang?

367
00:19:14,790 --> 00:19:16,810
How do you know Xiaoliang?

368
00:19:18,610 --> 00:19:20,560
What a terrible father.

369
00:19:21,750 --> 00:19:23,070
Not only do I know him,

370
00:19:23,550 --> 00:19:24,550
he's also a close friend of mine.

371
00:19:24,550 --> 00:19:25,270
Wait.

372
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:29,420
What do you mean

373
00:19:30,290 --> 00:19:32,030
when you say the money is

374
00:19:32,420 --> 00:19:33,400
for Xiaoliang?

375
00:19:33,810 --> 00:19:34,920
Eight years ago,

376
00:19:35,590 --> 00:19:37,440
Xiaoliang killed Du Juan for me.

377
00:19:37,930 --> 00:19:39,130
This is what I owe him.

378
00:19:49,420 --> 00:19:50,850
Han Pinmu.

379
00:19:51,960 --> 00:19:53,120
Evidence!

380
00:19:53,150 --> 00:19:54,950
What evidence do you have?

381
00:19:57,200 --> 00:19:58,930
You don't even know Xiaoliang.

382
00:19:58,940 --> 00:20:00,270
You're just framing him.

383
00:20:00,270 --> 00:20:02,230
You want to make him a scapegoat.

384
00:20:07,500 --> 00:20:08,310
It seems...

385
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:12,140
you really don't know him at all.

386
00:20:14,750 --> 00:20:16,100
In August 2003,

387
00:20:17,010 --> 00:20:18,700
Xiaoliang stole money from home

388
00:20:18,700 --> 00:20:20,080
and you beat him up,

389
00:20:20,680 --> 00:20:21,440
right?

390
00:20:22,100 --> 00:20:23,960
Do you know why he stole the money?

391
00:20:25,160 --> 00:20:26,510
Because he needed

392
00:20:26,510 --> 00:20:27,800
the transportation fare
and registration fee

393
00:20:27,800 --> 00:20:29,440
to go to the provincial capital

394
00:20:29,440 --> 00:20:31,310
with me and Hu Xiaofei

395
00:20:31,850 --> 00:20:33,910
for a 3-on-3 basketball tournament.

396
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:36,140
Xiaoliang is really good at basketball—

397
00:20:36,140 --> 00:20:37,800
you didn't know that, did you?

398
00:20:39,750 --> 00:20:40,770
Thanks to him,

399
00:20:41,210 --> 00:20:42,950
we won that game.

400
00:20:44,770 --> 00:20:46,100
He even learned from me.

401
00:20:47,460 --> 00:20:50,030
He said that was
his first time stealing money.

402
00:20:50,030 --> 00:20:51,470
You tied him up

403
00:20:52,170 --> 00:20:53,990
and beat him on the bed,

404
00:20:54,270 --> 00:20:54,980
right?

405
00:21:06,460 --> 00:21:07,500
Xin Jiran,

406
00:21:08,530 --> 00:21:10,660
you're a good cop.

407
00:21:11,110 --> 00:21:13,320
You don't care about personal feelings,

408
00:21:13,320 --> 00:21:14,670
only right and wrong.

409
00:21:15,050 --> 00:21:17,760
You placed righteousness
above family loyalty.

410
00:21:17,760 --> 00:21:20,220
You killed the real culprit
of the 3/12 Case,

411
00:21:21,050 --> 00:21:22,640
my good bro.

412
00:21:23,590 --> 00:21:25,070
What a hero you are.

413
00:21:35,570 --> 00:21:36,740
You have to

414
00:21:38,090 --> 00:21:39,690
keep this money safe

415
00:21:39,720 --> 00:21:40,990
for Xiaoliang.

416
00:22:02,340 --> 00:22:04,140
He couldn't have killed anyone.

417
00:22:11,920 --> 00:22:13,070
So,

418
00:22:14,460 --> 00:22:16,830
after you left Han Pinmu's house,

419
00:22:16,960 --> 00:22:19,490
you went straight
to the provincial capital?

420
00:22:21,160 --> 00:22:21,970
Yes.

421
00:22:23,640 --> 00:22:25,300
And I found this, as expected.

422
00:22:34,420 --> 00:22:36,280
Are you sure the voice in the recording

423
00:22:36,280 --> 00:22:37,720
is Xiaoliang's?

424
00:22:37,850 --> 00:22:39,660
It's my son's voice.

425
00:22:40,510 --> 00:22:41,680
I can't be wrong.

426
00:22:43,330 --> 00:22:46,050
Han Pinmu withdrew 350,000 yuan in cash.

427
00:22:46,070 --> 00:22:47,400
He gave 100,000 to you

428
00:22:47,550 --> 00:22:49,050
and 100,000 to Lin Guizhi.

429
00:22:49,530 --> 00:22:51,180
Do you know where the remaining 150,000

430
00:22:51,180 --> 00:22:52,530
went?

431
00:22:53,530 --> 00:22:54,500
I don't know.

432
00:22:57,570 --> 00:22:59,500
Hu Xiaofei's father was sentenced

433
00:22:59,700 --> 00:23:02,300
to life for embezzling
the compensation funds

434
00:23:04,070 --> 00:23:05,400
of laid-off workers.

435
00:23:06,850 --> 00:23:09,180
It couldn't have been given to him either.

436
00:23:24,030 --> 00:23:24,550
[Recording]

437
00:23:24,530 --> 00:23:26,900
Well, Xin...

438
00:23:24,770 --> 00:23:27,020
[Standby]

439
00:23:28,480 --> 00:23:31,220
We see the situation now.

440
00:23:32,900 --> 00:23:34,270
It's the father's fault

441
00:23:35,480 --> 00:23:37,080
if the son is not taught well.

442
00:23:40,810 --> 00:23:41,610
All right,

443
00:23:42,750 --> 00:23:45,170
go back and get a good sleep first, okay?

444
00:23:46,400 --> 00:23:47,700
In our line of work,

445
00:23:48,030 --> 00:23:49,830
we all disappoint our families.

446
00:23:50,350 --> 00:23:52,100
Before I was transferred
to the police station,

447
00:23:52,100 --> 00:23:54,030
I didn't even know what grade my son

448
00:23:54,370 --> 00:23:55,810
was in.

449
00:23:56,810 --> 00:23:59,070
His grades were at the bottom every year.

450
00:24:00,230 --> 00:24:01,830
By the time I realized it,

451
00:24:02,290 --> 00:24:03,960
he was already addicted to games

452
00:24:03,960 --> 00:24:05,560
and couldn't be pulled back.

453
00:24:06,510 --> 00:24:08,510
There are so many cases in the county

454
00:24:08,950 --> 00:24:10,450
waiting for us to solve.

455
00:24:11,270 --> 00:24:12,580
What can we do?

456
00:24:14,610 --> 00:24:16,740
Everyone has their own destiny.

457
00:24:17,650 --> 00:24:18,670
What's more,

458
00:24:19,110 --> 00:24:21,900
the 3/12 Case hasn't been solved yet.

459
00:24:22,760 --> 00:24:23,680
Mr. Xin,

460
00:24:24,160 --> 00:24:25,890
don't blame yourself too much.

461
00:24:30,420 --> 00:24:31,270
Bro,

462
00:24:31,960 --> 00:24:33,500
I'm begging you.

463
00:24:34,470 --> 00:24:36,160
If anything happens in the future,

464
00:24:36,160 --> 00:24:38,740
[Standby]

465
00:24:36,420 --> 00:24:38,150
let's communicate in advance.

466
00:24:38,400 --> 00:24:39,500
Don't always

467
00:24:40,920 --> 00:24:42,670
carry it all by yourself, okay?

468
00:25:08,460 --> 00:25:09,440
Here you go, sir.

469
00:25:09,440 --> 00:25:10,160
Thank you.

470
00:25:11,720 --> 00:25:13,350
Please chop it up for me.

471
00:25:17,170 --> 00:25:19,030
Three yuan worth of tofu, please.

472
00:25:52,220 --> 00:25:53,310
Yingying,

473
00:25:53,310 --> 00:25:55,480
stop playing. Open the door for Mom.

474
00:25:57,350 --> 00:25:59,160
Cheng brought us things again.

475
00:25:59,160 --> 00:26:00,680
Help me with them.

476
00:26:06,030 --> 00:26:08,000
I'm dying for a good drink.

477
00:26:08,110 --> 00:26:09,830
My mouth is completely tasteless.

478
00:26:09,830 --> 00:26:10,530
Now I realize

479
00:26:10,530 --> 00:26:12,730
how good being in the police station is.

480
00:26:13,640 --> 00:26:14,610
So much freedom.

481
00:26:15,680 --> 00:26:16,880
When the case is closed,

482
00:26:16,880 --> 00:26:18,480
I'll submit a report to Captain Fan,

483
00:26:18,480 --> 00:26:19,610
and we'll drink all night.

484
00:26:19,610 --> 00:26:20,960
Sounds good. Come on.

485
00:26:21,570 --> 00:26:22,460
Thank you, sir.

486
00:26:29,850 --> 00:26:31,050
Still the same taste.

487
00:26:31,070 --> 00:26:31,810
Delicious.

488
00:26:31,880 --> 00:26:32,700
Zhao and I

489
00:26:32,700 --> 00:26:35,310
used to come here all the time.

490
00:26:35,830 --> 00:26:36,700
We love this.

491
00:26:36,700 --> 00:26:38,070
We never get tired of it.

492
00:26:40,310 --> 00:26:41,500
Let me try some then.

493
00:26:49,160 --> 00:26:50,250
It's really good.

494
00:26:54,680 --> 00:26:55,880
Kid,

495
00:26:56,410 --> 00:26:58,210
you've been through so much life and death

496
00:26:58,210 --> 00:26:59,830
right after putting on the uniform.

497
00:26:59,830 --> 00:27:00,790
It's not easy.

498
00:27:04,660 --> 00:27:06,330
With your great qualifications,

499
00:27:06,330 --> 00:27:08,840
you could have worked
in a big provincial agency.

500
00:27:08,840 --> 00:27:09,960
Why did you insist on coming back

501
00:27:09,960 --> 00:27:11,200
to our small county

502
00:27:11,200 --> 00:27:12,270
to be a cop?

503
00:27:14,240 --> 00:27:16,530
To stay by my mom's side.

504
00:27:19,700 --> 00:27:20,570
Li Cheng,

505
00:27:21,180 --> 00:27:22,160
look at me.

506
00:27:22,880 --> 00:27:25,490
I've been keeping an eye on you lately.

507
00:27:25,650 --> 00:27:28,580
Those briefings posted by
our Criminal Investigation Corps—

508
00:27:28,580 --> 00:27:31,110
you prepared them a long time ago,
didn't you?

509
00:27:31,460 --> 00:27:33,960
Why do you care so much
about the 3/12 Case?

510
00:27:34,350 --> 00:27:35,610
What's your obsession

511
00:27:36,590 --> 00:27:38,250
with this case?

512
00:27:42,850 --> 00:27:43,850
It's for someone.

513
00:27:43,880 --> 00:27:44,530
Who?

514
00:27:46,900 --> 00:27:47,920
Bi Dehua.

515
00:27:48,920 --> 00:27:50,180
You know him?

516
00:27:53,440 --> 00:27:54,630
When I was little,

517
00:27:54,770 --> 00:27:56,510
my parents were busy

518
00:27:57,440 --> 00:27:59,350
working overtime at the factory.

519
00:28:00,080 --> 00:28:02,070
Dehua was the one who looked after me.

520
00:28:02,070 --> 00:28:03,800
Later, when we started school,

521
00:28:03,820 --> 00:28:05,470
we went together.

522
00:28:06,310 --> 00:28:07,930
♪ Lost in the haze of memory ♪

523
00:28:06,770 --> 00:28:08,500
He got busier with his studies,

524
00:28:09,160 --> 00:28:10,770
and he even became my dad's apprentice.

525
00:28:10,770 --> 00:28:12,240
♪ Piercing straight through my heart ♪

526
00:28:11,110 --> 00:28:12,260
In his free time,

527
00:28:12,290 --> 00:28:14,620
he'd go to the factory
to learn from my dad,

528
00:28:14,880 --> 00:28:18,370
♪ That youthful face,
why is all that remains ♪

529
00:28:15,160 --> 00:28:17,350
so we saw each other less.

530
00:28:18,530 --> 00:28:20,060
But every holiday,

531
00:28:19,320 --> 00:28:22,210
♪ Just a black cloth
and a line of infamy ♪

532
00:28:20,550 --> 00:28:22,410
he would teach me how to play ball.

533
00:28:24,000 --> 00:28:25,560
♪ I chase after time ♪

534
00:28:25,230 --> 00:28:26,800
But I will never forget

535
00:28:27,540 --> 00:28:29,360
that autumn in 2004.

536
00:28:28,450 --> 00:28:30,090
♪ I hide myself away ♪

537
00:28:29,390 --> 00:28:30,890
He was carried out

538
00:28:30,950 --> 00:28:32,040
as a corpse,

539
00:28:31,500 --> 00:28:33,310
[Police]

540
00:28:32,570 --> 00:28:36,180
♪ How many times have I run and fallen,
just so ♪

541
00:28:34,020 --> 00:28:35,430
and somehow

542
00:28:35,680 --> 00:28:37,290
was labeled as a murderer

543
00:28:37,040 --> 00:28:40,070
♪ The belated truth
could find a place to rest ♪

544
00:28:37,350 --> 00:28:38,830
and a rapist.

545
00:28:39,470 --> 00:28:40,730
From that day on,

546
00:28:40,750 --> 00:28:41,910
I swore

547
00:28:41,410 --> 00:28:43,070
♪ Who pretends to forget? ♪

548
00:28:42,050 --> 00:28:43,720
I would become a cop

549
00:28:43,900 --> 00:28:45,030
and clear his name,

550
00:28:45,770 --> 00:28:47,070
and tell everyone

551
00:28:45,930 --> 00:28:47,690
♪ Who flees in panic? ♪

552
00:28:47,790 --> 00:28:48,960
what kind of person

553
00:28:48,980 --> 00:28:50,980
Bi Dehua really was.

554
00:28:50,370 --> 00:28:53,750
♪ Above the abyss, who is watching? ♪

555
00:28:51,250 --> 00:28:52,530
One, two, one.

556
00:28:52,530 --> 00:28:55,110
One, two, three, four.

557
00:28:55,010 --> 00:28:58,090
♪ Under the heavens, who can escape? ♪

558
00:28:55,110 --> 00:28:57,680
One, two, three, four.

559
00:28:57,680 --> 00:28:59,660
One, two, three, four.

560
00:28:58,900 --> 00:29:01,080
♪ Even if the heat burns my life ♪

561
00:28:59,660 --> 00:29:01,570
One, two, three, four.

562
00:29:01,570 --> 00:29:04,030
One, two, one. One, two, one.

563
00:29:01,960 --> 00:29:04,300
♪ I'm unwilling to sacrifice my faith
as the price to pay ♪

564
00:29:04,030 --> 00:29:06,010
One, two, three, four

565
00:29:05,470 --> 00:29:05,900
♪ Raise your hands and surrender ♪

566
00:29:06,010 --> 00:29:08,010
One, two, three, four

567
00:29:06,600 --> 00:29:08,600
♪ The path of justice may be long ♪

568
00:29:09,600 --> 00:29:11,050
♪ Forever fighting against darkness ♪

569
00:29:11,820 --> 00:29:18,800
♪ And you're by my side;
you're the same as me ♪

570
00:29:29,420 --> 00:29:30,500
Bravo!

571
00:29:33,830 --> 00:29:34,980
I've never told anyone

572
00:29:34,980 --> 00:29:36,530
about this.

573
00:29:37,300 --> 00:29:38,380
I was afraid people would think

574
00:29:38,380 --> 00:29:40,200
I'd mix in personal feelings,

575
00:29:40,220 --> 00:29:41,570
lose my objectivity,

576
00:29:41,680 --> 00:29:42,850
and act on impulse.

577
00:29:43,860 --> 00:29:44,710
Of course,

578
00:29:45,110 --> 00:29:46,910
I constantly remind myself

579
00:29:46,930 --> 00:29:48,600
never to make that mistake.

580
00:29:49,140 --> 00:29:50,700
No wonder.

581
00:29:51,110 --> 00:29:52,220
When you

582
00:29:52,220 --> 00:29:53,420
deliberately showed off

583
00:29:53,420 --> 00:29:55,350
your computer gaming skills
in front of me,

584
00:29:55,350 --> 00:29:56,920
was it premeditated?

585
00:29:59,140 --> 00:29:59,830
Yes.

586
00:30:02,960 --> 00:30:03,740
Cheng.

587
00:30:05,920 --> 00:30:07,140
Risking your future

588
00:30:07,590 --> 00:30:09,220
and taking this path

589
00:30:09,550 --> 00:30:10,790
for one person,

590
00:30:11,120 --> 00:30:11,940
is it worth it?

591
00:30:15,600 --> 00:30:17,700
These 8 years have convinced me

592
00:30:18,140 --> 00:30:20,070
that this is the path I should take.

593
00:30:20,750 --> 00:30:21,590
It's worth it.

594
00:30:37,480 --> 00:30:40,680
[Dingdian Novel Website]

595
00:30:46,380 --> 00:30:48,130
[Abyss]

596
00:30:49,720 --> 00:30:50,090
[Reading history]

597
00:30:50,240 --> 00:30:51,330
["Abyss"
Writer: Han Sheng
Deleted]

598
00:30:56,090 --> 00:30:58,240
[Criminal Investigation Brigade
of Huangshui Public Security Bureau]

599
00:30:56,670 --> 00:30:58,370
The user logged in via a VPN.

600
00:30:58,570 --> 00:31:00,200
They bounced through

601
00:31:00,200 --> 00:31:01,330
at least 4 or 5 nodes.

602
00:31:01,550 --> 00:31:03,750
It'll be hard to crack in the short term.

603
00:31:05,140 --> 00:31:06,350
Hu Xiaofei is dead.

604
00:31:06,350 --> 00:31:07,420
And Han Pinmu is in the hospital

605
00:31:07,420 --> 00:31:09,290
under 24/7 surveillance.

606
00:31:09,590 --> 00:31:11,590
He couldn't have deleted it either.

607
00:31:11,590 --> 00:31:13,030
So it's most likely

608
00:31:13,030 --> 00:31:15,420
the third person

609
00:31:15,670 --> 00:31:16,930
hiding in the shadows.

610
00:31:19,030 --> 00:31:21,850
What's his reason for deleting the novel?

611
00:31:22,500 --> 00:31:25,090
To protect himself, or everyone.

612
00:31:25,610 --> 00:31:27,700
This person probably just found out

613
00:31:27,700 --> 00:31:29,750
the novel was posted online,

614
00:31:29,750 --> 00:31:31,380
and realized the content

615
00:31:31,380 --> 00:31:33,240
was based on the 3/12 Case.

616
00:31:33,260 --> 00:31:34,640
He was afraid of things being exposed,

617
00:31:34,640 --> 00:31:35,940
so he just deleted it

618
00:31:35,940 --> 00:31:37,250
to prevent future trouble.

619
00:31:37,250 --> 00:31:38,380
But he didn't expect

620
00:31:38,550 --> 00:31:39,830
that we already knew.

621
00:31:42,110 --> 00:31:43,440
Anyway,

622
00:31:43,470 --> 00:31:45,800
this person finally got anxious
and showed his face.

623
00:31:45,800 --> 00:31:46,860
That's a slip-up.

624
00:31:47,880 --> 00:31:49,450
Now that he's exposed,

625
00:31:49,980 --> 00:31:51,810
don't let him hide again.

626
00:31:52,460 --> 00:31:53,180
Fan Jie.

627
00:31:53,850 --> 00:31:54,790
Have the task force

628
00:31:54,790 --> 00:31:57,030
come up with
a breakthrough plan immediately.

629
00:31:57,030 --> 00:31:59,010
I want to see a clear direction
for the investigation.

630
00:31:59,010 --> 00:31:59,610
Yes, sir.

631
00:32:04,390 --> 00:32:11,900
[Huangshui Public Security]

632
00:32:04,610 --> 00:32:05,380
Li Cheng,

633
00:32:06,090 --> 00:32:07,660
you always have a lot of ideas.

634
00:32:07,660 --> 00:32:08,660
What do you think?

635
00:32:09,460 --> 00:32:10,480
I think the key

636
00:32:10,480 --> 00:32:12,240
is still Han Pinmu.

637
00:32:12,250 --> 00:32:13,650
There are two directions

638
00:32:13,660 --> 00:32:15,220
I want to dig deeper into.

639
00:32:15,510 --> 00:32:17,070
One is his obsession

640
00:32:17,070 --> 00:32:18,900
with the truth behind his mother's death.

641
00:32:18,900 --> 00:32:19,530
The other

642
00:32:19,530 --> 00:32:21,700
is the whereabouts of the 150,000 in cash.

643
00:32:21,700 --> 00:32:24,200
I remember when Xin was the captain,

644
00:32:24,230 --> 00:32:25,860
he talked his ear off,

645
00:32:25,880 --> 00:32:27,670
telling him hundreds of times

646
00:32:27,700 --> 00:32:29,850
that it was just
an ordinary traffic accident.

647
00:32:29,850 --> 00:32:31,680
The driver responsible
was brought to justice.

648
00:32:31,680 --> 00:32:34,530
How else can we investigate this?

649
00:32:34,890 --> 00:32:36,800
I checked Fang Meng's file.

650
00:32:36,820 --> 00:32:38,960
He was sentenced to 3 years
and 6 months back then.

651
00:32:38,960 --> 00:32:40,370
He was about to be released.

652
00:32:40,370 --> 00:32:41,810
But during his sentence,

653
00:32:41,880 --> 00:32:43,080
he got an extra 9 years

654
00:32:43,080 --> 00:32:45,060
for intentional assault.

655
00:32:45,080 --> 00:32:46,410
This is too unusual.

656
00:32:46,470 --> 00:32:48,540
How could an ordinary traffic offender

657
00:32:48,540 --> 00:32:49,950
commit

658
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:51,200
such frequent and vicious assaults

659
00:32:51,200 --> 00:32:52,700
in prison?

660
00:32:52,720 --> 00:32:55,050
Could it be because of his violent temper?

661
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:55,980
It's prison.

662
00:32:55,980 --> 00:32:58,240
Anything can happen in a place like that.

663
00:32:58,630 --> 00:33:00,470
I can't rule out that possibility,

664
00:33:00,470 --> 00:33:01,550
but I still want

665
00:33:01,550 --> 00:33:03,550
to apply to investigate further
in the prison.

666
00:33:03,550 --> 00:33:04,510
It's a clue.

667
00:33:04,570 --> 00:33:05,830
Let's start from here.

668
00:33:06,610 --> 00:33:08,540
As for Han Pinmu getting beaten up,

669
00:33:09,050 --> 00:33:11,010
I've figured something else out.

670
00:33:11,830 --> 00:33:14,320
He was willing to help Chen Chunli
clean up the scene.

671
00:33:14,320 --> 00:33:16,370
That says a lot in itself.

672
00:33:16,870 --> 00:33:18,410
He might feel that

673
00:33:18,440 --> 00:33:20,370
he owes Chen Chunli something too.

674
00:33:20,740 --> 00:33:22,000
I suspect

675
00:33:22,000 --> 00:33:24,400
Chen Chunli also took
a share of that money.

676
00:33:26,830 --> 00:33:27,790
Guangwen,

677
00:33:28,240 --> 00:33:30,810
have Yang Feng keep an eye
on Chen Chunli's bank statements.

678
00:33:30,810 --> 00:33:32,430
Report any movement immediately.

679
00:33:32,430 --> 00:33:33,460
In short,

680
00:33:33,550 --> 00:33:35,610
we need to act.
We can't just sit here.

681
00:33:48,860 --> 00:33:49,790
You can go in now.

682
00:33:49,880 --> 00:33:50,560
Thank you.

683
00:33:51,600 --> 00:33:53,590
[Sihai Prison, Ping'an Province]

684
00:33:58,720 --> 00:34:00,240
Nothing is unusual

685
00:34:00,240 --> 00:34:02,160
but a transfer of 300,000

686
00:34:01,530 --> 00:34:03,380
[Transaction amount: 300,000]

687
00:34:02,160 --> 00:34:04,000
received on May 3rd, 2004.

688
00:34:04,100 --> 00:34:05,250
Who sent the money?

689
00:34:05,070 --> 00:34:06,240
[Xihai City Bank]

690
00:34:05,350 --> 00:34:07,200
The remitter's account name is Liu Cui.

691
00:34:06,280 --> 00:34:08,690
[Sender information]
[Name: Liu Cui]

692
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:08,190
Her ID shows

693
00:34:08,190 --> 00:34:10,530
she's from Youfen Village, Jinhe County
in the neighboring province.

694
00:34:10,530 --> 00:34:12,070
She is 73 years old this year.

695
00:34:12,070 --> 00:34:14,900
What's the relationship between
this Liu Cui and Chen Chunli?

696
00:34:14,900 --> 00:34:15,880
The system shows

697
00:34:15,880 --> 00:34:17,500
they have no other financial transactions

698
00:34:17,500 --> 00:34:19,139
besides this transfer.

699
00:34:19,340 --> 00:34:21,460
However, Liu Cui also received 300,000

700
00:34:21,460 --> 00:34:22,420
on May 3rd,

701
00:34:22,510 --> 00:34:24,389
[Transfer]
[Sent to: Chen Chunli]

702
00:34:22,550 --> 00:34:24,360
and then immediately transferred it
to Chen Chunli.

703
00:34:24,360 --> 00:34:25,380
In other words,

704
00:34:25,380 --> 00:34:27,340
this Liu Cui is just a middleman.

705
00:34:27,370 --> 00:34:28,820
Then who sent the money to her?

706
00:34:28,820 --> 00:34:30,070
It's a corporate account,

707
00:34:29,949 --> 00:34:31,659
[Transfer]
[Shanghai Futong Trading Co., Ltd.]

708
00:34:30,070 --> 00:34:31,300
registered in Shanghai.

709
00:34:31,300 --> 00:34:33,110
It shows as a trading company.

710
00:34:33,110 --> 00:34:34,300
On the surface,

711
00:34:34,300 --> 00:34:36,190
it has nothing to do with
Chen Chunli, Liu Cui,

712
00:34:36,190 --> 00:34:37,860
or Han Pinmu, whom you mentioned

713
00:34:37,860 --> 00:34:38,900
earlier.

714
00:34:38,900 --> 00:34:40,280
Please help me check again.

715
00:34:40,280 --> 00:34:42,150
See if Chen Chunli makes

716
00:34:42,150 --> 00:34:44,679
regular transfers to
any specific accounts.

717
00:34:44,710 --> 00:34:45,780
Fang Meng.

718
00:34:46,070 --> 00:34:47,550
In 2001,

719
00:34:47,550 --> 00:34:49,510
you were sentenced to 3 years
and 6 months in prison

720
00:34:49,510 --> 00:34:51,920
for drunk driving causing death.

721
00:34:51,920 --> 00:34:54,210
But on May 9th, 2004,

722
00:34:54,230 --> 00:34:55,840
while serving your sentence,

723
00:34:55,840 --> 00:34:57,550
you got an additional 3 years

724
00:34:57,550 --> 00:34:59,000
for intentional injury.

725
00:34:59,030 --> 00:35:01,860
At that time, you were less than
5 months away from being released.

726
00:35:01,860 --> 00:35:04,050
Why did you choose to make a move then?

727
00:35:04,510 --> 00:35:06,230
It's ancient history.

728
00:35:06,650 --> 00:35:08,130
I can't remember.

729
00:35:08,380 --> 00:35:10,940
Someone probably provoked me,

730
00:35:11,380 --> 00:35:12,700
and I couldn't hold back,

731
00:35:12,700 --> 00:35:13,690
so I fought back.

732
00:35:16,760 --> 00:35:18,220
According to the records,

733
00:35:18,630 --> 00:35:20,880
you were the one who provoked them.

734
00:35:21,860 --> 00:35:22,780
Officer,

735
00:35:23,400 --> 00:35:24,480
I really can't remember.

736
00:35:24,480 --> 00:35:26,140
Then let me help you remember.

737
00:35:26,440 --> 00:35:28,420
On April 17th, 2004,

738
00:35:28,440 --> 00:35:29,480
Du Juan died.

739
00:35:29,480 --> 00:35:31,280
You heard the news in prison.

740
00:35:31,300 --> 00:35:33,040
You were afraid Han Pinmu would
take revenge on you,

741
00:35:33,040 --> 00:35:34,760
so you intentionally got
your sentence extended

742
00:35:34,760 --> 00:35:36,250
to hide in prison,

743
00:35:36,280 --> 00:35:37,070
right?

744
00:35:38,590 --> 00:35:40,120
What are you talking about?

745
00:35:40,300 --> 00:35:41,830
Why would I be afraid of him?

746
00:35:41,890 --> 00:35:43,210
You were afraid he'd find out

747
00:35:43,210 --> 00:35:44,820
that Du Juan instigated you

748
00:35:44,820 --> 00:35:46,530
to kill Han Pinmu's mother.

749
00:35:47,000 --> 00:35:48,630
So after Du Juan was killed,

750
00:35:48,650 --> 00:35:50,800
you would be next.

751
00:35:51,800 --> 00:35:52,730
What do you mean?

752
00:35:53,480 --> 00:35:54,550
So he's really the one who killed Du Juan?

753
00:35:54,550 --> 00:35:55,570
"Really"?

754
00:35:55,860 --> 00:35:57,280
It seems you are not surprised

755
00:35:57,280 --> 00:35:58,870
by this conclusion at all.

756
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:00,300
As far as we know,

757
00:36:00,320 --> 00:36:03,330
you and Du Juan were just
ordinary colleagues.

758
00:36:03,550 --> 00:36:04,320
Why

759
00:36:04,550 --> 00:36:05,690
do you care so much

760
00:36:05,690 --> 00:36:07,800
about her cause of death
when you're in prison?

761
00:36:07,800 --> 00:36:09,730
You even have your own deductions.

762
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:13,960
Days are hard in here,

763
00:36:14,260 --> 00:36:15,550
and I have nothing to do all day.

764
00:36:15,550 --> 00:36:18,860
So I just keep thinking about these

765
00:36:18,860 --> 00:36:20,050
random things.

766
00:36:21,780 --> 00:36:23,300
In February 2007,

767
00:36:23,300 --> 00:36:24,730
while serving your sentence,

768
00:36:24,730 --> 00:36:26,570
you got an extra 6 years

769
00:36:26,570 --> 00:36:28,280
for a second intentional injury.

770
00:36:28,280 --> 00:36:29,490
Looking at it,

771
00:36:29,670 --> 00:36:31,730
your sentence should be up next year.

772
00:36:32,130 --> 00:36:32,920
So,

773
00:36:33,300 --> 00:36:35,210
what have you been thinking about lately?

774
00:36:35,210 --> 00:36:38,010
Thinking about how to get
your sentence extended?

775
00:36:39,340 --> 00:36:40,900
You've got me all wrong.

776
00:36:41,860 --> 00:36:44,130
I ran over Han Pinmu's mom and killed her.

777
00:36:44,860 --> 00:36:46,030
I accepted

778
00:36:46,030 --> 00:36:47,510
all the penalties and fines.

779
00:36:47,510 --> 00:36:50,130
Th-Those two incidents in here
were truly accidents.

780
00:36:50,130 --> 00:36:52,190
It's not as complicated as you think.

781
00:36:52,360 --> 00:36:55,340
Han Pinmu has terminal liver cancer now.

782
00:36:55,800 --> 00:36:57,510
What he can't let go of

783
00:36:57,510 --> 00:36:59,460
is the truth about his mother's death.

784
00:36:59,460 --> 00:37:00,980
Now that Du Juan is dead,

785
00:37:01,190 --> 00:37:02,980
Han Pinmu doesn't have much time left.

786
00:37:02,980 --> 00:37:05,180
You've been in prison for so many years.

787
00:37:05,290 --> 00:37:06,860
Aren't you going to

788
00:37:06,900 --> 00:37:08,710
tell us the truth?

789
00:37:21,860 --> 00:37:22,900
I said everything

790
00:37:24,230 --> 00:37:25,670
I needed to say back then.

791
00:37:26,520 --> 00:37:27,430
That is

792
00:37:28,970 --> 00:37:30,300
the whole truth.

793
00:37:35,980 --> 00:37:37,940
I rushed back immediately

794
00:37:37,940 --> 00:37:40,270
after my meeting with the county leaders,

795
00:37:40,270 --> 00:37:41,330
but I'm still late.

796
00:37:42,830 --> 00:37:44,810
Seeing my employee's child

797
00:37:44,840 --> 00:37:46,280
become so successful

798
00:37:46,550 --> 00:37:47,650
makes me really happy.

799
00:37:47,650 --> 00:37:49,820
It's like seeing my own kid.

800
00:37:50,630 --> 00:37:51,860
You flatter me.

801
00:37:52,010 --> 00:37:53,800
My mom has worked here for over a decade,

802
00:37:53,800 --> 00:37:56,330
but she never had the chance
to speak with you.

803
00:37:57,400 --> 00:37:58,360
That's on me.

804
00:37:59,230 --> 00:38:02,120
How can I help you?

805
00:38:02,260 --> 00:38:03,780
Nothing big.

806
00:38:04,230 --> 00:38:04,980
Mr. Li,

807
00:38:05,090 --> 00:38:07,550
Homesickness is also your business, right?

808
00:38:07,980 --> 00:38:09,530
Yes. Why?

809
00:38:10,280 --> 00:38:11,880
We just want to ask about a waitress

810
00:38:11,880 --> 00:38:14,010
who used to work there,

811
00:38:14,010 --> 00:38:14,760
Du Juan.

812
00:38:17,730 --> 00:38:19,320
You mean that tall girl

813
00:38:19,320 --> 00:38:21,180
who looked like a model?

814
00:38:23,190 --> 00:38:25,000
Poor girl.

815
00:38:25,630 --> 00:38:26,730
Such a tragic fate.

816
00:38:27,230 --> 00:38:28,860
A waitress from 10 years ago,

817
00:38:28,860 --> 00:38:30,340
and you remember her so clearly?

818
00:38:30,340 --> 00:38:31,940
I remember her very clearly.

819
00:38:32,150 --> 00:38:34,950
Every girl from Homesickness
is quite something.

820
00:38:35,130 --> 00:38:38,090
This Du Juan was even more so.

821
00:38:39,480 --> 00:38:40,950
Do you know who she

822
00:38:41,210 --> 00:38:42,610
hooked up with back then?

823
00:38:43,820 --> 00:38:44,780
Han Sheng.

824
00:38:45,090 --> 00:38:46,550
He was the Boss's most favored driver

825
00:38:46,550 --> 00:38:48,130
at the time.

826
00:38:48,130 --> 00:38:50,010
A lot of people were very jealous

827
00:38:50,070 --> 00:38:51,570
of her for that.

828
00:38:51,590 --> 00:38:52,880
I remember Han Sheng

829
00:38:52,910 --> 00:38:54,470
had a wife back then.

830
00:38:55,700 --> 00:38:57,820
Who can say for sure
when it comes to relationships?

831
00:38:57,820 --> 00:39:00,350
Didn't Du Juan have a boyfriend
back then too?

832
00:39:01,170 --> 00:39:03,190
Du Juan had a boyfriend?

833
00:39:03,220 --> 00:39:03,930
Yeah.

834
00:39:04,860 --> 00:39:06,460
I heard from my subordinates

835
00:39:06,480 --> 00:39:08,740
that the money Du Juan made
in her early years

836
00:39:08,740 --> 00:39:10,400
was all spent on her boyfriend's mother's

837
00:39:10,400 --> 00:39:11,510
medical bills.

838
00:39:12,670 --> 00:39:13,630
Later on,

839
00:39:14,050 --> 00:39:15,610
she moved up in the social ladder—

840
00:39:15,610 --> 00:39:17,070
it's understandable.

841
00:39:18,950 --> 00:39:20,360
Do you know anything

842
00:39:20,380 --> 00:39:21,510
about this boyfriend?

843
00:39:21,510 --> 00:39:23,070
That I don't know.

844
00:39:23,940 --> 00:39:25,480
But I seem to remember

845
00:39:26,440 --> 00:39:27,920
he worked at a technical school,

846
00:39:27,920 --> 00:39:30,210
teaching people how to repair cars.

847
00:39:31,350 --> 00:39:33,080
Do you remember his name?

848
00:39:33,900 --> 00:39:35,280
I didn't even remember it back then,

849
00:39:35,280 --> 00:39:36,810
how could I remember it now?

850
00:39:41,150 --> 00:39:43,400
I have a meeting coming up,

851
00:39:43,400 --> 00:39:44,300
so...

852
00:39:44,630 --> 00:39:45,940
Thank you for

853
00:39:46,170 --> 00:39:47,800
your time.

854
00:39:52,730 --> 00:39:53,880
It seems

855
00:39:53,900 --> 00:39:54,750
Fang Meng

856
00:39:54,770 --> 00:39:56,690
is most likely Du Juan's ex-boyfriend.

857
00:39:56,690 --> 00:39:58,690
If Li Zhengbin's statement is true,

858
00:39:58,760 --> 00:40:00,230
Du Juan once did everything
she could to pay for

859
00:40:00,230 --> 00:40:02,560
Fang Meng's mother's medical treatment.

860
00:40:02,690 --> 00:40:04,150
It's possible that

861
00:40:04,150 --> 00:40:05,670
