00:40:18,980 --> 00:40:20,090
I wonder if

871
00:40:20,400 --> 00:40:23,190
Han Pinmu has the time
to wait for that day.

872
00:40:26,660 --> 00:40:28,700
What, feeling sorry for him?

873
00:40:28,720 --> 00:40:30,230
I just think that

874
00:40:30,260 --> 00:40:32,210
